  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper evaluates Quantum Amplitude Estimation for pricing basket options using real Yahoo Finance data for baskets of 3–9 assets. With 3–4 uncertainty qubits per asset, QAE achieves <1% pricing deviation for 3–4 asset baskets but errors grow to ~14–16% for 6–9 assets due to discretization and independence assumptions. The work only demonstrates accuracy behavior in simulation while citing the theoretical quadratic speedup of QAE (O(1/ε) vs Monte Carlo O(1/ε²)).",
